### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health
### Registrar Usuario
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "cedula": "1234567890",
  "nombre": "Juan Pérez",
  "edad": 45,
  "peso": 75.5,
  "altura": 1.75,
  "sexo": "M",
  "enfermedad": "diabetes",
  "colorEnfermedad": "#FF5733",
  "glucosaInicial": 120,
  "colesterolInicial": 200
}
### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "cedula": "1234567890"
}
### Verificar Estado de Cuenta (requiere token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/status
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
### Obtener Estadísticas del Doctor
GET http://localhost:3000/api/doctor/stats
x-doctor-token: doctor_secret_token_2026
### Obtener Usuarios Pendientes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/doctor/users/pending
x-doctor-token: doctor_secret_token_2026
### Activar Usuario
POST http://localhost:3000/api/doctor/users/1/activate
Content-Type: application/json
x-doctor-token: doctor_secret_token_2026
{
  "doctorCedula": "9999999999"
}
### Crear Registro de Salud
POST http://localhost:3000/api/registros-salud
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
{
  "glucosa": 110,
  "colesterol": 190,
  "presionSist": 120,
  "presionDias": 80,
  "peso": 74.5,
  "observaciones": "Me siento bien"
}
### Obtener Registros de Salud
GET http://localhost:3000/api/registros-salud?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
